cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this atlas or its app, please cite it as below."
title: "Human Plasma Immune Atlas: an open, genetics-anchored causal map of the plasma immunome across the human disease phenome"
abstract: >-
  An interactive, fully public atlas linking 672 plasma immune proteins to 2,466
  FinnGen R12 disease endpoints through 1.66 million cis-eQTL Mendelian
  randomization tests, Bayesian colocalization, protein-level INTERVAL plasma
  pQTL confirmation, independent non-FinnGen and UK Biobank replication, an
  immune-cell/inflammation layer, and a novelty and therapeutic-direction
  engine. Every figure is computed live from the underlying result tables and
  is downloadable as CSV; the app requires no account or login.
authors:
